><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>To change levels of access for users for the Order Tracking database, find the following groups in the view on the right.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>	HECS_GD_Orders_Admin</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>	HECS_GD_Orders_Editors</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>	HECS_GD_Orders_Investigators (to be created.  Does not exist as of August 14, 2002)</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>	HECS_GD_Orders_Readers</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Double-click on the group you want to edit.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Make the necessary changes to the group and then click on the "Save and Exit" button on the action bar.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font size='14pt' style='bold underline' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20' color='blue'/>2. Adding an employee to the Project List</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>1.Launch the Orders database</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>2. Select the Admin button to launch the Admin navigator</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>3. Click on the Projects button (highlighted in red below)</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>4. Open every project which the employee needs access to, and add his/hname to the list.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>5. Save</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
